#: ../../tools/ensembl_overlap_tools.rst:66 4651f58c6d3249e2a8cf5c343fb8dbe8
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get all genomic features overlapping a specified "
"chromosomal region. Returns genes, transcripts, regulatory elements, "
"constrained elements, and other features within the coordinates. "
"Essential for understanding the functional landscape of a genomic region,"
" finding genes near a variant, or identifying regulatory elements in a "
"locus. Supports multiple feature types in one query. Example: region "
"'7:140424943-140524564' (BRAF locus) returns 5 genes, 20 regulatory "
"elements, and 82 constrained elements; region '17:7661779-7687546' (TP53 "
"locus) returns genes, enhancers, CTCF binding sites, and promoters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ensembl_overlap_tools.rst:70 726fc64a4fef4902a8fd25fe639c0381
msgid ""
"``species`` (string) (optional) Species name. Default: 'human'. Examples:"
" 'human', 'mouse', 'rat', 'zebrafish'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ensembl_overlap_tools.rst:73 fea292f614944e9382b749984749615d
msgid ""
"``region`` (string) (required) Genomic region in format 'chr:start-end'. "
"Examples: '17:7661779-7687546' (TP53), '7:140424943-140524564' (BRAF), "
"'13:32315086-32400266' (BRCA2). Max region size ~5Mb."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ensembl_overlap_tools.rst:76 af086481474447d2afb9e23051daa00d
msgid ""
"``feature_types`` (string) (optional) Comma-separated feature types to "
"retrieve. Options: 'gene', 'transcript', 'regulatory', 'constrained', "
"'variation', 'repeat', 'motif'. Default: 'gene'. Example: "
"'gene,regulatory,constrained'."
msgstr ""

